# Streamify front-end — install & build artifacts.
#
# Repo convention (mirrors the root .gitignore policy): Cargo.lock IS
# committed — an app shipping native Rust deps pins its dependency
# graph exactly. The same logic applies here: front-end/package-lock.json
# is committed so CI's hashFiles key pins the npm graph; only derived
# build output and local state are ignored.

node_modules/
web/dist/
crates/*/pkg/
target/
.wrangler/
.env
.env.*
.vite/
*.tsbuildinfo
*.log
